# Exceptions: advisor card ratings are derived from an EXTERNAL site
# (ing-gom/sts2-card-advisor) that can change/disappear, so we commit a
# snapshot. Regenerate with: agent/build_advisor_ratings.py
!data/advisor_card_ratings.json
!data/advisor_card_tags.json
# The rest of greedy_action's local data (agent/greedy_trace.py GREEDY_DATA_FILES + data/relics.json, read by
# agent/state_encoder.py): the Windows advice service runs from a clone and has no other copy of them.
# deck_predictor_v2.pkl needs the scikit-learn pinned in requirements-advisor.txt.
!data/card_empirical.json
!data/card_metadata.json
!data/card_q_values.json
!data/card_synergies.py
!data/deck_predictor_v2.pkl
!data/ironclad_card_tags.json
!data/ironclad_cards.json
!data/relics.json
# Fitted route models (Phase 3b) are small and committed. A file cannot be
# re-included while its parent directory is excluded, so re-include agent/data/
# first and ignore everything in it except the models.
!agent/data/
agent/data/*
!agent/data/route_model_*.json
checkpoints_*/
decks.html
boss_decks.html
decks_boss.html
workbench.png
